  "storyId": "1stact_level_a001_ex01_end",
  "groupId": "1stact",
  "stageId": "a001_ex01",
  "title": "大地驚雷",
  "storyCode": "GT-EX-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_ex01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "614dccc81355fb301244a0ea7f92a0c5d4668ee3f2dd3d542bcfc09c62226233",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......我們該把他塞進麻袋，\n在黎明時吊上桅杆......\n......我們該把他喉嚨切斷，\n在暴風雨裡獻給大海......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "......又是這個夢嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "是誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "——原來是你。唔，不過為什麼我想不起來你叫什麼名字了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "這不重要。你把我當成一個普通的羅德島幹員就可以了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你看上去似乎很痛苦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "只是噩夢而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "一些盤旋在意識裡的黑色碎片，藏在那個破碎教堂的陰影之下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "在我接近它的時候，它們化為枷鎖將我拖入深邃的海中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不過很快你就有辦法脫離痛苦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "是嗎，呵呵，那可真是太好了。不過我為什麼相信你呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "你身上的氣息......我很熟悉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "不，不是，是氣味。濃烈的氣味，血的氣味，它們的氣味。深邃的海中的氣味。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "熟悉，但又讓人厭惡的氣味。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "是嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "能告訴我你的名字嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "斯卡蒂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "有趣。那麼你為什麼能出現在這裡呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "沒有凱爾希的許可，你可沒法到這個房間裡來，除非你也不怕被失去控制的我撕成碎片。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "害怕。所有人都害怕。只是我已經習慣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "是時候出發了，回來的時候，情況也許會有所進展。不過，你也可以和以前一樣，把我忘了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "text": "你要去哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "秘密被埋葬的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "一個離你很遠的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
